*Ramont Turnbull, development manager<ref>{{cite web |title=Candidate Filing Report |url=https://sos.idaho.gov/elections/data/Candidate_Filing_Report.pdf|website=Idaho Secretary of State |access-date=3 March 2022}}</ref>

